---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms & Conditions | Next Wave Dev" description="Read our Terms of Service.">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] overflow-hidden bg-background px-5 pb-0 pt-10 text-white md:px-8 md:pt-12">
    <section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1289px] px-0">
      
      <!-- UNIFIED RESPONSIVE PAGE HERO -->
      <div class="w-full flex flex-col lg:overflow-hidden rounded-[10px] bg-gradient-to-b from-surface to-background border border-border-subtle p-6 md:p-0 shadow-xl mt-4 md:mt-0">
        <section class="relative flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:h-[489px] w-full items-center text-center md:text-left gap-6 md:gap-0">
          
          <div class="xl:absolute xl:left-[47px] xl:top-[19px] z-10 flex h-[150px] w-[150px] xl:h-[390px] xl:w-[390px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-accent-primary to-accent-secondary border border-border-subtle shadow-2xl mx-auto md:mx-0 p-2 md:p-8">
            <span class="block w-full font-heading text-[18px] sm:text-[20px] md:text-[34px] lg:text-[38px] font-bold leading-tight md:leading-[1.1] text-white text-center drop-shadow-md break-words">
              Terms &<br/>Conditions
            </span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="xl:absolute xl:left-[470px] flex flex-col w-full xl:w-[650px] gap-3 md:gap-4 z-10 md:pr-8">
            <h1 class="m-0 font-roboto text-[22px] md:text-[48px] lg:text-[56px] font-bold leading-tight md:leading-[1.1] text-white break-words">Terms of Service</h1>
            <p class="m-0 font-sans text-[15px] md:text-[22px] lg:text-[24px] font-normal leading-relaxed md:leading-[33px] text-text-body">Please read these terms and conditions carefully before using our service or interacting with our platform.</p>
          </div>
          
        </section>
      </div>
      
    </section>

    <!-- Content Block -->
    <section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1000px] mt-16 md:mt-24 pb-12">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 rounded-[20px] bg-surface border border-border-subtle p-8 shadow-xl lg:p-12">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <h3 class="font-roboto text-[24px] md:text-[32px] font-bold text-white">1. Acceptance of Terms</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-[16px] md:text-[18px] font-normal leading-relaxed text-text-body">By accessing the Next Wave Dev platform or purchasing our services, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you disagree with any part of these terms, you may not access our website or utilize our digital services.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <h3 class="font-roboto text-[24px] md:text-[32px] font-bold text-white">2. Billing & Subscriptions</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-[16px] md:text-[18px] font-normal leading-relaxed text-text-body">Our core services are offered as a recurring monthly subscription. By enrolling in a subscription plan, you authorize Next Wave Dev (via our payment processor, Stripe) to charge your payment method on a recurring monthly basis until cancelled. You may cancel your subscription at any time, effective at the end of your current billing cycle.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <h3 class="font-roboto text-[24px] md:text-[32px] font-bold text-white">3. Deliverables & IP Ownership</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-[16px] md:text-[18px] font-normal leading-relaxed text-text-body">Next Wave Dev retains all intellectual property rights to the digital products, code, and designs we create during your engagement until your invoice or subscription payment for that period is paid in full. Upon full payment, intellectual property rights for the finalized deliverables transfer to you, the client.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <h3 class="font-roboto text-[24px] md:text-[32px] font-bold text-white">4. Warranties & Liability</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-[16px] md:text-[18px] font-normal leading-relaxed text-text-body">While we are committed to delivering high-quality, professional code and design, our services are provided "as-is." Next Wave Dev shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from the use or inability to use the websites or applications we build.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <h3 class="font-roboto text-[24px] md:text-[32px] font-bold text-white">5. Governing Law</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-[16px] md:text-[18px] font-normal leading-relaxed text-text-body">These Terms shall be governed and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Washington, United States, without regard to its conflict of law provisions. Any dispute arising from these terms will be resolved exclusively in the state and federal courts located in Washington.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>